326
00:21:45.369 --> 00:21:48.671
So we'll start with #38?

327
00:21:53.210 --> 00:21:54.235
Kevin.

328
00:21:54.336 --> 00:21:55.553
Yeah?

329
00:21:55.671 --> 00:22:00.933
