472
00:31:17.232 --> 00:31:20.158
You didn't even pay for it. they did!

473
00:31:20.527 --> 00:31:23.303
Son. have some more. Eat up!

474
00:31:23.404 --> 00:31:24.221
Yes. Dad.

475
00:31:24.322 --> 00:31:25.347
Eat your fill!

476
00:31:25.448 --> 00:31:27.683
